    entity:routing-optimization-platform-proposal a onto:Entity,
            class:proposal,
            owl:NamedIndividual,
            skos:Concept ;
        rdfs:label "Routing optimization platform proposal" ;
        fact:assumptions "Business does not currently correlate routing inefficiencies to financial impact, making a traditional ROI-led business case hard to build",
            "Mapping data from Google Maps or HERE Maps API with 2024+ data; routing optimisation remains within assigned territories with hard boundary enforcement across all CUs",
            "Pilot deployed to one commercial unit before nationwide rollout; external map/traffic providers abstracted via adapter layer",
            "Revenue optimisation is added only after the routing foundation (updated maps, dynamic adjustments, territory compliance) is proven in the pilot" ;
        fact:business-need "Optimised, territory-compliant routing for frontliners across 11 commercial units with compliance tracking, coverage gap analysis and KPI visibility for rep performance and efficiency" ;
        fact:delivery-shape "Five-phase methodology for controlled risk and rapid value delivery: 1 Discover – Current State Assessment (audit tools, processes & data flows; map pain points to technical requirements); 2 Design – Solution Architecture (define routing engine, APIs, territory model & UX for GTM and frontliners); 3 Build – MVP Development (core routing: updated maps, dynamic adjustments, territory rules, analytics); 4 Pilot – Controlled Validation (deploy to one commercial unit; measure KPIs, gather feedback, iterate); 5 Scale – Nationwide Rollout (extend to all 11 commercial units with advanced optimisation features)",
            "Phase 4 Pilot (controlled validation): deploy to one commercial unit, measure KPIs, gather feedback, iterate. Phase 5 Scale (nationwide rollout): extend to all 11 commercial units with advanced optimisation features",
            "Structured, low-risk path from current state assessment to a live pilot" ;
        fact:exploration-backlog "Revenue impact / financial optimisation in routing decisions potentially addressed later once routing basics are solved" ;
        fact:proposal-stage "Draft presentation (current and target state)" ;
        fact:proposal-summary "From today's constraints to tomorrow's capability: replace an outdated, manual, compliance-focused routing tool with a modern optimization platform supporting dynamic daily routes, territory-aware optimization, and near-real-time visibility",
            "Modular, backend-driven routing optimization platform supporting operational and planning use cases, with consumption layer (Frontliner Tools, Go-to-Market Tool, Dashboards), Core Routing Platform, and supporting data ingestion, API/integration and monitoring layers",
            "Structured, low-risk path from current state assessment to a live pilot, built around CCEAP's operations rather than off-the-shelf tooling, covering four capability areas for routing optimisation" ;
        fact:proposed-solution "Consumption layer: Frontliner Tool 1 (frequent route consumption), Frontliner Tool 2 (daily / intra-day updates), Go-to-Market Tool (scenario planning & visibility), Dashboards (KPIs, compliance, coverage)",
            "Core Routing Platform: External Map Services (maps, traffic, distance matrix, geocoding), Map/Traffic Adapter (provider abstraction), Routing Optimization Engine (route calculation & recalculation), Rules & Constraints Service (territories, feasibility, priorities); plus Data Ingestion & Validation Layer (quality checks, geocoding readiness, refresh orchestration), API & Integration Layer (route plans, updates, execution status, compliance signals), Monitoring & Audit (performance, data quality, route versions)",
            "Four capability areas: (1) Routing Engine Integration - Google Maps / HERE Maps API with 2024+ data, real-time traffic and road condition awareness, turn-by-turn mobile navigation for field reps; (2) Dynamic Route Management - daily & intra-day adjustments, no CSV uploads, automated exception handling for weather & accidents, promo and upsell priority routing support; (3) Territory & Compliance - hard territory boundary enforcement across all CUs, route optimisation within assigned territories, compliance tracking with deviation flagging; (4) Analytics & Visibility - near-real-time route execution dashboards, coverage gap analysis for underserved areas, KPI tracking for efficiency and rep performance",
            "Modern, flexible routing platform using updated maps (e.g., Google Maps 2024) enabling dynamic daily route adjustments and route optimization within assigned territories without penalizing valid deviations",
            "Routing platform built on a core routing foundation (updated maps, dynamic adjustments, territory rules, analytics), validated in a pilot and then scaled nationwide with advanced optimisation features" ;
        fact:scope "Core routing foundation; pilot in one commercial unit; nationwide rollout to all 11 commercial units with advanced optimisation features; revenue optimisation layered later",
            "Initial focus on routing optimization across Routing Engine Integration, Dynamic Route Management, Territory & Compliance, and Analytics & Visibility; revenue impact treated as secondary",
            "Initial focus on routing optimization; revenue impact is secondary and potentially addressed later",
            "MVP focused on one Commercial Unit with routing fundamentals first (updated maps, dynamic adjustments, territory rules, analytics); extensible for national rollout to all 11 commercial units and advanced optimization" ;
        fact:solution-direction "Built around CCEAP's operations rather than off-the-shelf tooling; routing optimisation first, with revenue impact considered secondary",
            "Hard territory boundary enforcement across all CUs; route optimisation within assigned territories; compliance tracking with deviation flagging; near-real-time route execution dashboards; coverage gap analysis for underserved areas; KPI tracking for efficiency and rep performance",
            "Shift from compliance tracking to optimization-driven routing that replaces the outdated platform",
            "Start with routing fundamentals (updated maps, dynamic adjustments, territory compliance) and layer revenue optimisation only after the foundation is proven" ;
        fact:target-context "CCEAP field sales routing: 11 commercial units nationwide, GTM central planning, Sales Reps in the field, strict territory control",
            "Fastest and most efficient way to complete weekly routes; better coverage of underserved areas; real-time or near-real-time visibility on route compliance and execution",
            "Organisation with 11 commercial units; pilot targets one unit before scaling to all 11",
            "Source systems and data inputs: Customer / Outlet master data; Territories boundaries; Assignments reps / visits; Execution Data GPS / status" ;
        onto:kind "Proposal" ;
        relation:proposal-for-client entity:cceap ;
        relation:proposal-source-note entity:current-target-state-routing-presentation-draft ;
        relation:proposal-uses-technology entity:api-integration-layer,
            entity:core-routing,
            entity:data-ingestion-validation-layer,
            entity:external-map-services,
            entity:frontliner-tools,
            entity:go-to-market-tool,
            entity:google-maps,
            entity:here-maps,
            entity:map-traffic-adapter,
            entity:monitoring-audit,
            entity:route-execution-dashboards,
            entity:routing-optimization-engine,
            entity:rules-constraints-service ;
        rdfs:comment "Proposed modern, flexible routing platform using updated maps, supporting dynamic daily route adjustments and optimizing routes within assigned territories without penalizing valid deviations" ;
        skos:altLabel "Modern, flexible routing platform",
            "Routing MVP",
            "Routing optimisation proposal",
            "Routing optimization platform proposal",
            "Routing platform proposal",
            "Solution Architecture",
            "Target routing platform",
            "routing platform proposal" ;
        skos:prefLabel "Routing optimization platform proposal" .

