        rdf:object "Replace outdated, largely manual route planning (manual uploading of Excel/CSV files into an outdated, inflexible, non-intuitive tool with complex backend calculations requiring constant user input); challenges affect service levels (scheduled call list, route planning, route compliance), sales and volume delivery, and financials (no actual data yet). Initiative prompted by outdated platform, complexity of usage and manual interventions." ;
