        rdf:object "Node types: problems, solutions, capabilities; features: filter mode by category (Problem Domain, Capability category, Solution domain), node focus mode via double-click, optional visual layers layout (problems top, solutions middle, capabilities bottom), switchable node labels (names only or names + categories with visual indicators), hover pop-up with other item columns, side detail view on left-click with related items list, optional export file for import into a commonly known tool" ;
