        rdf:object "Store mapping step (Where are the stores?) using OpenStreetMap to compute distance and time matrices; Optimization layer with three models: Store Schedule Assignment (What day(s) to visit each store on?), Daily Route Optimization (How to visit the stores?) and Weekly Schedule Creation (How to allocate merchandisers to routes?); Presentation layer with Power BI Dashboard, Performance Insights report and Opportunities analysis" ;
        rdf:predicate fact:proposed-solution ;
        rdf:subject entity:merchandiser-store-visit-routing-and-scheduling-optimization ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/text-ontology/document/doc-e68fe065f017f95e> .

