        rdf:object "Azure-based optimization platform using FICO Xpress as the solver: Snowflake as main data source, Azure Data Factory for additional flat file ingestion, Azure Databricks with bronze/silver/gold data layers and a model store, ADLS Gen2 storage, Azure Logic Apps, client's SharePoint storage, OpenStreetMap API for map data, MLflow, Azure DevOps CI/CD (ADO Repo and Pipelines), Azure Active Directory for developer and MLflow user access, vNet with public and private subnets, Key Vault, Log Analytics and Application Insights for monitoring, with Power BI reports (POC/MVP) as the reporting layer" ;
        rdf:predicate fact:proposed-solution ;
        rdf:subject entity:merchandiser-route-optimization-proposal-fico-as-a-solver ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/text-ontology/document/doc-e68fe065f017f95e> .

